  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Expert - Trade &amp; Investment  climate, Bryssel - National Expert - Trade &amp; Investment  climate, Bryssel, RYA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert - Handel och Investering klimat, Bryssel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r en sekundering som skall arbeta  inom omr&#xe5;de f&#xf6;r handel och investeringsklimat och utveckling av den privata sektorn. Hantera handelspolitik, handelsst&#xf6;d, handel och h&#xe5;llbar utveckling. Potentiellt &#xe4;ven arbeta med konkurrenskraft och handelsfr&#xe4;mjande f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja Global Gateway.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The position is a secondment to work in the area of ??trade and investment climate and private sector development. Manage trade policy, trade support, trade and sustainable development. Potentially also work with competitiveness and trade promotion to support the Global Gateway.</narrative>
  </description>
